&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect, build, and maintain full-stack applications using TypeScript, Next.js, React, and Node.js across our product surface area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end feature delivery from database schema and API design through frontend UI/UX, including observability, testing, and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architectural decisions across the stack, balancing speed with long-term durability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
