&lt;li&gt;Lead the integration of LLM-powered capabilities into production systems — prompt engineering, tool-use frameworks, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), and multi-agent orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand up and evolve AI platform infrastructure as the roadmap matures — model serving, orchestration, and evaluation pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Streaming &amp;amp; Real-Time Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
